Package: kconsensus
Title: Transparent Consensus Diagnostics for K-Means Cluster Counts
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compares candidate K-means cluster counts using internal indices,
    reference-simulation gap statistics and optional elbow recommendations.
    Reports equal-weight method agreement, abstentions, score diagnostics and
    customizable plots without treating vote agreement as statistical confidence.
